          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mam! Nai tokona, iwokete iyes Sukus ŋolo ituruwosi iyes erwosit kus ka Kaiwan ekacerit ŋolo ituruwosi iyes akuj kus ka iwokete iyes ŋitorubei ŋulu ipotu iyes kiceut erae ŋakujo kus, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.5.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.5.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
